OL,9,     Fgeneral knowledge to come up with
OL,10,     Fthe answers that no-one else can
OL,11,     Fthink of.
OL,12,G0530 Attenborough's Natural Curiosities
OL,13,     FShocking Senses: Sir David
OL,14,     FAttenborough shines the spotlight
OL,15,     Fon an array of animals that baffle
OL,16,     Fand fascinate. We learn about how
OL,17,     Fnaturalists found out some eels
OL,18,     Fwere electric!
